#. Tag: date
#: whatsnew.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid "2014-08-30"
msgstr "30.8.2014."

#. Tag: releaseinfo
#: whatsnew.docbook:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "4.7.01"
msgstr "4.7.01"

#. Tag: title
#: whatsnew.docbook:8
#, no-c-format
msgid "What's new in this release"
msgstr "Šta je novo u ovoj verziji"

#. Tag: para
#: whatsnew.docbook:10
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As with every release, the &kappname; development team has been working hard "
"to make this release better and easier to use in every way. We have also "
"made quite a few improvements. We are confident you will like what you see."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: whatsnew.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In addition to numerous bug fixes, this version also includes new features "
"and functionality. Although all new features have had some testing, this is "
"considered a development release, in preparation for a full release 4.8 "
"early in 2015."
msgstr ""
"Uz brojne prepravke bug-ova, ova verzija također uključuje nove opcije i "
"funkcionalnosti. Iako su sve nove opcije već imale neka testiranja, ovo "
"smatramo radnom verzijom, u pripremi za puno izdanje 4.8 u ranoj 2015."

#. Tag: para
#: whatsnew.docbook:23
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here are some of the new features found in this release:"
msgstr "Ovo su neke od novih opcija u ovom izdanju:"

#. Tag: para
#: whatsnew.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Transaction tags were added. This was long requested feature and allows an "
"improved categorization of transaction."
msgstr ""
"Transakcijske oznake su dodane. Ovo je dugo tražena opcija i dopušta "
"unaprijeđenu kategorizaciju transakcije."

#. Tag: para
#: whatsnew.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Better performance of the user interface. Performance in general has been "
"improved by fixing performance issues spotted using a profiler."
msgstr ""
"Bolje performanse korisničkog interfejsa. Generalne performanse su "
"unaprijeđene tako što su popravljeni problemi sa performansom uočeni "
"koristeći profiler."

#. Tag: para
#: whatsnew.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Proper input methods support was added. &kappname; can now be safely used "
"with languages that need input methods for easier use."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: whatsnew.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Added a frozen column to improve visualizing forecast details. This way the "
"account name won't be shifted out of the view when horizontally scrolling "
"the forecast details."
msgstr ""
"Dodana je zamrznuta kolona da se popravi vizualizacija detalja prognoze. Na "
"ovaj način, ime računa neće biti pomjereno izvan vidokruga kada se "
"horizontalno listaju detalji prognoze."

#. Tag: para
#: whatsnew.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "The application icons were improved."
msgstr "Unaprijeđene su ikone aplikacije."

#. Tag: para
#: whatsnew.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Many improvements in the importing and online banking modules, including:"
msgstr "Mnoga poboljšanja u uvozu i online bankovnim modulima, uključujući:"

#. Tag: para
#: whatsnew.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid "The homepage can show accounts online banking status."
msgstr "Naslovna strana sada može prikazati status online bankarstva računa."

#. Tag: para
#: whatsnew.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "OFX plugin now allows custom application version."
msgstr "OFX plugin sada dozvoljava proizvoljnu verziju aplikacije."

#. Tag: para
#: whatsnew.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "There is a new plugin to export csv files."
msgstr "Postoji novi plugin za izvoz csv datoteka."
